am_te_14","textTraditional":"齊熙郡","sentenceOrder":217},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_218","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"交州，鎮交阯，在海漲島中。楊雄箴曰：「交州荒遰，水與天際。」外接南夷，寶貨所出，山海珍怪，莫與為比。民恃險遠，數好反叛。領郡如左：","sentenceOrder":218},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_219","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"九真郡","sentenceOrder":219},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_220","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"移風　胥浦　松原　高安　建初　常樂　津梧　軍安　吉龐〔二三〕　武寧","sentenceOrder":220},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_221","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"武平郡","sentenceOrder":221},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_222","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"武定　封溪　平道　武興　根寧　南移","sentenceOrder":222},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_223","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"新昌郡","sentenceOrder":223},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_224","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"范信　嘉寧　封山　西道　臨西　吳定　新道　晉化","sentenceOrder":224},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_225","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"九德郡","sentenceOrder":225},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_226","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"九德　咸驩　浦陽　南陵　都洨〔二四〕　越常　西安","sentenceOrder":226},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_227","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"日南郡","sentenceOrder":227},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_228","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"西捲〔二五〕　象林　壽冷　朱吾　比景　盧容　無勞","sentenceOrder":228},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_229","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"交阯郡","sentenceOrder":229},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_230","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"龍編　武寧　望海　句漏　吳興　西于　朱〈截，中\"隹改鳥\"〉　南定　曲昜　海平　羸〈阝婁〉〔二六〕","sentenceOrder":230},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_231","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"宋平郡","sentenceOrder":231},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_232","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"昌國　義懷　綏寧","sentenceOrder":232},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_233","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"宋壽郡建元二年，割越州屬。","sentenceOrder":233},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_234","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"義昌郡永元二年，改沃屯置。","sentenceOrder":234},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_235","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"越州，鎮臨漳郡，本合浦北界也。夷獠叢居，隱伏巖障，寇盜不賓，略無編戶。宋泰始中，西江督護陳伯紹獵北地，見二青牛驚走入草，使人逐之不得，乃誌其處，云「此地當有奇祥」。啟立為越州。七年，始置百梁、隴蘇、永寧、安昌、富昌、南流六郡，割廣、交朱〈截，中\"隹改鳥\"〉三郡屬。元徽二年，以伯紹為刺史，始立州鎮，穿山為城門，威服俚獠。土有瘴氣殺人。漢世交州刺史每暑月輒避處高，今交土調和，越瘴獨甚。刺史常事戎馬，唯以貶伐為務。","sentenceOrder":235},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_236","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"臨漳郡","sentenceOrder":236},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_237","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"漳平　丹城　勞石　容城　長石　都并　緩端","sentenceOrder":237},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_238","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"合浦郡","sentenceOrder":238},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_239","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"徐聞　合浦　朱盧　新安　晉始　蕩昌　朱豐　宋豐　宋廣","sentenceOrder":239},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_240","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"永寧郡","sentenceOrder":240},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_241","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"杜羅　金安　蒙　廖簡　留城","sentenceOrder":241},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_242","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"百梁郡","sentenceOrder":242},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_243","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"百梁　始昌　宋西","sentenceOrder":243},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_244","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"安昌郡","sentenceOrder":244},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_245","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"武桑　龍淵　石秋　撫林","sentenceOrder":245},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_246","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"南流郡","sentenceOrder":246},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_247","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"方度","sentenceOrder":247},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_248","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"北流郡永明六年立，無屬縣。","sentenceOrder":248},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_249","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"龍蘇郡","sentenceOrder":249},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_250","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"龍蘇","sentenceOrder":250},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_251","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"富昌郡","sentenceOrder":251},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_252","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"南立　義立　歸明","sentenceOrder":252},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_253","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"高興郡","sentenceOrder":253},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_254","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"宋和　寧單　高興　威成　夫羅　南安　歸安　陳蓮　高城　新建","sentenceOrder":254},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_255","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"思築郡","sentenceOrder":255},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_256","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"鹽田郡","sentenceOrder":256},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_257","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"杜同","sentenceOrder":257},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_258","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"定川郡","sentenceOrder":258},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_259","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"興昌","sentenceOrder":259},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_260","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"隆川郡","sentenceOrder":260},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_261","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"良國","sentenceOrder":261},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_262","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"齊寧郡建元二年置，割鬱林之新邑、建初二縣并。","sentenceOrder":262},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_263","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"開城建元二年置　延海　新邑　建初","sentenceOrder":263},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_264","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"越中郡","sentenceOrder":264},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_265","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"馬門郡","sentenceOrder":265},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_266","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"鍾吳　田羅　馬陵　思寧","sentenceOrder":266},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_267","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"封山郡","sentenceOrder":267},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_268","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"安金","sentenceOrder":268},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_269","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"吳春俚郡永明六年立，無屬縣。","sentenceOrder":269},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_270","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"齊隆郡先屬交州，中改為□□。永泰元年，改為齊隆，還屬□州。　〔二七〕","sentenceOrder":270},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_271","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"校勘記","sentenceOrder":271},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_272","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"〔一〕　淩　南監本、局本作「廣陵」。按成孺宋州郡志校勘記云：「考異云『陵』當作『淩』，『廣』字衍。是也。南齊書正作『淩』。」","sentenceOrder":272},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_273","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"〔二〕　淮浦建武二年省　「二年」毛本、局本作「三年」。","sentenceOrder":273},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_274","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"〔三〕　甄城　錢大昕廿二史考異云：「按宋州郡志無此縣。若云鄄城之訛，則已見南濮陽，不當重出也。」","sentenceOrder":274},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_275","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"〔四〕　繹幕建武二年省　「二年」毛本、局本作「三年」。","sentenceOrder":275},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_276","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"〔五〕　榆次建武二年省　「二年」毛本、局本作「三年」。","sentenceOrder":276},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_277","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"〔六〕　南魯郡建武二年省　「二年」毛本、局本作「三年」。","sentenceOrder":277},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_278","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"〔七〕　新（治）〔冶〕　據宋書州郡志改。","sentenceOrder":278},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_279","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"〔八〕　茹（田）〔由〕　據宋書州郡志改。","sentenceOrder":279},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_280","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"〔九〕　于湖永明八年省（甬）〔角〕城高平下邳三縣并　通鑑齊建元三年胡注云「甬城」當作「角城」，今據改。按水經淮水注「淮泗之會即角城也」，楊守敬疏證云各書「甬」「角」錯出。","sentenceOrder":280},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_281","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"〔一０〕齊寧永明元年置　「永」原訛「元」，據殿本、局本改正。","sentenceOrder":281},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_282","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"〔一一〕有（平）陽〔平〕石鱉　據局本改。下同。按錢大昕廿二史考異云：「據下文，當為陽平郡，轉寫傎倒耳。周山圖傳亦云於石鱉立陽平郡。」","sentenceOrder":282},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_283","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"〔一二〕陽平郡寄治山陽　錢大昕廿二史考異云：「按陽平郡治石鱉，在山陽境內。」","sentenceOrder":283},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_284","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"〔一三〕雖相去機事　「機」字原闕，據南監本、殿本、局本補。","sentenceOrder":284},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_285","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"〔一四〕豫章　晉書地理志同。宋書州郡志作「豫寧」。按王曇首追封豫寧縣侯，見宋書本傳。然宋書王僧綽傳、南齊書王儉傳均作襲封豫章縣侯，僧綽，曇首子，儉，曇首孫也。南史僧綽傳、儉傳則又並作襲封豫寧縣侯，與宋志合。又文選任昉王文憲集序稱儉襲爵豫寧縣侯，李善注引蕭子顯齊書亦作「豫寧」。則疑齊書舊本亦作豫寧。此豫章疑亦豫寧之訛。","sentenceOrder":285},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_286","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"〔一五〕綏城　南監本及宋書州郡志作「綏成」。","sentenceOrder":286},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_287","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"〔一六〕懷安　宋書州郡志作「安懷」。按梁書蘭欽傳云欽封安懷縣男，疑作「安懷」是。","sentenceOrder":287},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_288","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"〔一七〕臨沇　漢書地理志、晉書地理志、宋書州郡志並作「臨允」。","sentenceOrder":288},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_289","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"〔一八〕甘泉　宋書州郡志作「甘東」。","sentenceOrder":289},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_290","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"〔一九〕遂城　元和郡縣志同。宋書州郡志、隋書地理志作「遂成」。","sentenceOrder":290},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_291","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"〔二０〕遂度　宋書州郡志作「逐度」。","sentenceOrder":291},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_292","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"〔二一〕中留　南監本、局本及續漢書郡國志作「中溜」。漢書地理志、宋書州郡志作「中留」。","sentenceOrder":292},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_293","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"〔二二〕簡陽　宋書州郡志作「潤陽」，云永初郡國作「簡陽」。按成孺宋州郡志校勘記云「潤」為「澗」字之訛。","sentenceOrder":293},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_294","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"〔二三〕吉龐　南監本及漢書地理志、宋書州郡志作「都龐」。","sentenceOrder":294},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_295","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"〔二四〕都洨　宋書州郡志作「都汱」。","sentenceOrder":295},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_296","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"〔二五〕西捲　漢書地理志、隋書地理志同。殿本及續漢書郡國志、宋書州郡志並作「西卷」。","sentenceOrder":296},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_297","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"〔二六〕羸〈阝婁〉　南監本及宋書州郡志作「羸婁」。按成孺宋州郡志校勘記云：「漢志作『羸〈阝婁〉』，續志作『嬴〈阝婁〉』，晉志作『羸〈阝婁〉』，南齊志同漢志。」","sentenceOrder":297},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_14_298","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_14","textTraditional":"〔二七〕齊隆郡先屬交州中改為□□永泰元年改為齊隆還屬□州　張元濟百衲本南齊書跋云：「殿本志第六越州齊隆郡，注先屬交州，中改為關，永泰元年改為齊隆，還屬關州。按是本並無兩『關』字，原文漫漶不可辨。南監本同汲古閣本各空一格，北監本則各注『闕』字，殿本遂誤為『關』。郡名豈有改為關之理，而當時更無所謂關州。」","sentenceOrder":298}],"overrides":{}}